# SEO — Page Rules

## Every Page Needs generateMetadata

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT — every page.tsx must export this
import type { Metadata } from 'next'
const BASE_URL = `https://${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_DOMAIN ?? 'citytaxihorw.ch'}`

export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: 'Flughafentransfer Luzern',  // will be formatted as "... | Citytaxi Horw"
  description: '...',
  alternates: { canonical: `${BASE_URL}/services` },
  openGraph: {
    title: '...',
    description: '...',
    url: `${BASE_URL}/services`,
    images: [{ url: '/assets/og-default.jpg', width: 1200, height: 630 }],
  },
}

// ✅ Dynamic routes use generateMetadata()
export async function generateMetadata({ params }): Promise<Metadata> { ... }
```

**Never use `metadata` and `generateMetadata` in the same file.**

## Schema Markup (JSON-LD)

Add `LocalBusiness` schema on homepage, `Service` schema on service pages:

```typescript
// In page.tsx or layout.tsx
const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'TaxiService',
  name: 'Citytaxi Horw',
  url: 'https://citytaxihorw.ch',
  telephone: '+41415144444',
  address: {
    '@type': 'PostalAddress',
    streetAddress: 'Kantonsstrasse 130',
    addressLocality: 'Horw',
    postalCode: '6048',
    addressCountry: 'CH',
  },
  areaServed: { '@type': 'City', name: 'Luzern' },
  openingHours: 'Mo-Su 00:00-24:00',
}

// Render as:
<script type="application/ld+json"
  dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: JSON.stringify(schema) }}
/>
```

**Never add `aggregateRating` unless real reviews are verified on-page.**

## Blog Posts (ISR)

```typescript
// src/app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx
export const revalidate = 3600  // re-generate every hour

export function generateStaticParams() {
  return blogData.posts.map(p => ({ slug: p.slug }))
}
```

## Images

```typescript
// ✅ ALWAYS next/image
import Image from 'next/image'
<Image src="/assets/hero.webp" alt="Taxi Horw – Citytaxi Horw" width={1200} height={600} priority />

// ❌ NEVER <img>
<img src="/assets/hero.webp" />
```

- `alt` text must be descriptive German, include relevant keywords naturally
- Use `priority` on above-the-fold images
- Use `fill` + `sizes` for responsive images inside positioned containers

## Canonical URL Pattern

```
Homepage:    https://citytaxihorw.ch/
Services:    https://citytaxihorw.ch/services
Blog post:   https://citytaxihorw.ch/blog/flughafentransfer-tipps
```

Always use `NEXT_PUBLIC_DOMAIN` env var, never hardcode the domain in page files.

## Sitemap Checklist

`src/app/sitemap.ts` must include:
- All static pages (/, /services, /pricing, /about, /contact, /booking)
- All blog slugs from `src/data/pages/blog.json`
- `changeFrequency` and `priority` set appropriately

## German Text Rules (MANDATORY)

| ✅ Correct (UI) | ❌ Wrong (UI) | URL slug |
|---|---|---|
| Für Firmen | Fuer Firmen | `/fuer-firmen` |
| Flughafentransfer | Flughafen Transfer | `/flughafentransfer` |
| Über uns | Ueber uns | `/about` |
| Zürich | Zuerich | `zuerich` |

Umlauts (ü ö ä Ü Ö Ä ß) **must** appear in UI text. URL slugs use ASCII — that is correct and intentional.
